  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Midde Rajivulla vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 2 January, 2020 Author: C.Praveen Kumar Bench: C.Praveen Kumar Honourable Sri Justice C.Praveen Kumar Criminal Petition No.6727 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "1. This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner / Accused under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in C.C.No.72 of 2019 on the file of the Court of the learned Judicial First Class Magistrate, Atmakur. The alleged offences against the petitioner are under sections 188, 272 of IPC and Section 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner so also the learned Public Prosecutor submits that the issue involved in the present case is squarely covered by the common order, dated 18.12.2019, of this Court in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch.",
